WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.158
Unit four. Visiting the Doctor!

2
00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:07.604
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.654 --> 00:00:11.345
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:15.307
Today we learn about Visiting the Doctor. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:19.493
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

6
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.590
Nurse. Say it with me. Nurse!

7
00:00:30.093 --> 00:00:33.394
Checkup. Say it with me. Checkup!

8
00:00:36.891 --> 00:00:40.158
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

9
00:00:43.659 --> 00:00:47.292
Medicine. Say it with me. Medicine!

10
00:00:50.792 --> 00:00:54.426
Question. Say it with me. Question!

11
00:00:57.939 --> 00:01:01.389
Height. Say it with me. Height!

12
00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:08.172
Weight. Say it with me. Weight!

13
00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:19.886
I visit the doctor for a checkup to make sure I am healthy. The nurse measures my height and weight. I can ask a question if I feel unsure about my medicine.

14
00:01:19.936 --> 00:01:21.086
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.445 --> 00:01:27.629
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.679 --> 00:01:28.829
Checkup!

17
00:01:29.744 --> 00:01:35.078
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.250
Height!

19
00:01:36.937 --> 00:01:43.293
Did you know? Regular checkups help doctors find and fix small health problems early!

20
00:01:43.343 --> 00:01:45.537
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.253 --> 00:01:54.528
Think and answer. Why is it important to visit a doctor for a checkup?

22
00:01:54.578 --> 00:01:55.728
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.857 --> 00:02:01.819
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.869 --> 00:02:04.514
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

